<title>USA: Salt Lake Cty Bldg Auth, Utah, won by G.K. Baum.</title>
<headline>Salt Lake Cty Bldg Auth, Utah, won by G.K. Baum.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>George K. Baum said it won $13.8 million of Salt Lake Cty Municipal Building Authority, Utah, lease revenue bonds, Series 1996 A, with a true interest cost of 5.81 percent.</p>
</text>
